.eggs/
# Anchored to the backend on purpose. Unanchored, `lib/` matches at any depth
# and silently swallows `frontend/app/lib/`, where Next.js keeps shared modules
# by convention - files vanish from `git add` with no error. Python lives only
# under backend/, and every real lib/ in this repo is already inside .venv/,
# node_modules/ or .next/, each ignored by its own rule.
/backend/lib/
/backend/lib64/
parts/
sdist/
var/
wheels/
share/python-wheels/
*.egg-info/
.installed.cfg
*.egg
